using Global

~ ending_start

Noman: (long pause, reviewing his notes) You've been more careful than I expected.

Noman: Fine. We'll do this your way.

Jason: I want the severance doubled, and I want it in writing that this conversation never happened — for both our sakes.

Noman: (a beat) Done.

if Global.reckoning_choice == "copied":
	Noman: I don't know what you took off that terminal on your last day. I have a guess. Let's both pretend I don't.
elif Global.volkov_path == "held_line":
	Noman: For what it's worth — the Volkov account. Turning down the hardware interface. That's the only reason this went as smooth as it did.

Jason: (He walked out with more than he came in asking for. He told himself that made him smart. He didn't quite believe it.)

# --- ENDING: LEVERAGED ---
# Jason outplayed Gunman Corp. He gets the best material outcome —
# and the game closes on him not being sure that's a win.

=> END
